Follow-up disposition: `GroupRegistry::clear()` can still send
`PendingReplyCompletion::ProducerShutdown` for a request registered directly
against a Rust `ClientRuntime` before startup fails. The public Java Producer
API has no matching pre-start registration path. This Rust-only lifecycle case
remains explicitly open for the broad reverse/API audit; the request/reply
matrix status remains PARTIAL.

